  "details": "I just logged in and went through my usual routine for minimizing lag by emtying the cahce and all. then i went to the perf. options page in the safety tab and double checked that but when I closed it then suddenly the menu moved up and down out and ended up out of place. I got confused so tried to replicate it and easy enough when closing the perf. options page i found out that it was my avatar reloading as if I had just changed avatar. \nIt's a quite minor bug as it only happens in that specific sequence but thought it would still be worth noting\nPS. in case wondering no I did not changed any perf. options just simply opened it to check on it",
